{"id":"CH-Testing","title":"20. BEAM 生态中的测试","html":"<div class=\"sect1\"> <h2 id=\"CH-Testing\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"CH-Testing\" href=\"#CH-Testing\">20. BEAM 生态中的测试</a></h2> <div class=\"sectionbody\"> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_introduction_3\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_introduction_3\" href=\"#_introduction_3\">20.1. 引言</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在本章中，我们将探讨如何在开发过程中保证 Erlang 代码的可靠性与健壮性。我们先从 EUnit 开始，这是一个流行的测试框架，让你能轻松地为应用程序编写和运行测试。</p> </div> <div class=\"sect3\"> <h4 id=\"_eunit\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_eunit\" href=\"#_eunit\">20.1.1. EUnit</a></h4> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>EUnit 是一个 Erlang 单元测试框架，允许你对程序中各个独立的单元进行测试。这些单元可以小到函数和模块，大到进程甚至整个应用程序。EUnit 帮助你编写测试、运行测试并分析测试结果，从而确保代码正确可靠。</p> </div> <div class=\"sect4\"> <h5 id=\"_basics_and_setup\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_basics_and_setup\" href=\"#_basics_and_setup\">基础与配置</a></h5> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>要在你的 Erlang 模块中使用 EUnit，请在 <code>-module</code> 声明之后加入下面这一行：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"ni\">include_lib</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"eunit/include/eunit.hrl\"</span><span class=\"p\">).</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>这一行让你能够使用 EUnit 的各项功能，并导出一个 <code>test()</code> 函数，用于运行模块中的所有单元测试。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect4\"> <h5 id=\"_writing_test_cases_and_test_suites\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_writing_test_cases_and_test_suites\" href=\"#_writing_test_cases_and_test_suites\">编写测试用例与测试套件</a></h5> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>要创建一个简单的测试函数，请定义一个名称以 <code>_test()</code> 结尾、且不接受任何参数的函数。它应当通过返回一个值来表示成功，或通过抛出异常来表示失败。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>配合 <code>=</code> 使用模式匹配，可以编写更高级的测试用例。例如：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"nf\">reverse_nil_test</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">[]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nn\">lists</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">reverse</span><span class=\"p\">([]).</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>另一种做法是使用 <code>?assert(Expression)</code> 宏来编写对表达式进行求值的测试用例：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"nf\">length_test</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"nf\">assert</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">length</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">])</span> <span class=\"o\">=:=</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">).</span></code></pre> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect4\"> <h5 id=\"_running_tests_and_analyzing_results\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_running_tests_and_analyzing_results\" href=\"#_running_tests_and_analyzing_results\">运行测试并分析结果</a></h5> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>如果你已在模块中引入 EUnit 声明，那么就编译该模块并运行自动导出的 <code>test()</code> 函数。例如，如果你的模块名为 <code>m</code>，就调用 <code>m:test()</code> 来对该模块中的所有测试运行 EUnit。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>EUnit 也可以使用 <code>eunit:test/1</code> 函数来运行测试。例如，调用 <code>eunit:test(m)</code> 等价于调用 <code>m:test()</code>。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>要把测试代码与普通代码分开，请在名为 <code>m_tests</code> 的模块中编写测试函数——前提是你的模块名为 <code>m</code>。当你让 EUnit 测试模块 <code>m</code> 时，它也会查找模块 <code>m_tests</code> 并运行其中的测试。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>EUnit 会捕获测试函数的标准输出，因此如果测试代码向标准输出写入内容，这些文本不会出现在控制台上。要绕开这一点，可以使用 EUnit 的调试宏，或写入 user 输出流，例如 <code>io:format(user, \"~w\", [Term])</code>。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>关于检查被测单元所产生输出的更多信息，请参见 EUnit 文档 <sup class=\"footnote\" id=\"_footnote_source-testing-eunit\">[<a class=\"footnote\" data-ref=\"_footnotedef_74\" href=\"#_footnotedef_74\" id=\"_footnoteref_74\">74</a>]</sup> 中关于输出检查宏的部分。</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect3\"> <h4 id=\"_common_test\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_common_test\" href=\"#_common_test\">20.1.2. Common Test</a></h4> <div class=\"sect4\"> <h5 id=\"_basics_and_setup_2\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_basics_and_setup_2\" href=\"#_basics_and_setup_2\">基础与配置</a></h5> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Common Test（CT）是 Erlang/OTP 自带的一个强大测试框架，用于编写和运行测试套件。它同时支持白盒测试与黑盒测试，因而成为测试 Erlang 应用程序、分布式系统乃至与外部系统交互时的灵活选择。</p> </div> <div class=\"sect5\"> <h6 id=\"_installing_common_test\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_installing_common_test\" href=\"#_installing_common_test\">安装 Common Test</a></h6> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>如果你的 Erlang 是完整安装的，Common Test 应该已经包含在内。不过，如果你使用的是精简安装或自定义构建，可以通过把 <code>common_test</code> 应用加入依赖来确保它可用。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>要检查 <code>common_test</code> 是否已安装：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nn\">application</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">ensure_all_started</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">common_test</span><span class=\"p\">).</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>如果使用 <code>rebar3</code>，请确保它已加入你的依赖：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">deps</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">common_test</span><span class=\"p\">]}.</span></code></pre> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect4\"> <h5 id=\"_creating_a_basic_test_suite\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_creating_a_basic_test_suite\" href=\"#_creating_a_basic_test_suite\">创建基本测试套件</a></h5> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Common Test 套件其实就是一个遵循特定结构的 Erlang 模块。首先创建一个名为 <code>sample_SUITE.erl</code> 的文件，把它放在 <code>test/</code> 目录下。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>示例 <code>sample_SUITE.erl</code>：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"ni\">module</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">sample_SUITE</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n<span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"ni\">compile</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">export_all</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">% Common Test includes these callbacks\n</span><span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"ni\">include_lib</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"common_test/include/ct.hrl\"</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">% Test suite information\n</span><span class=\"nf\">suite</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">[{</span><span class=\"n\">timetrap</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">seconds</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">}}].</span>  <span class=\"c\">% Time limit for tests\n</span>\n<span class=\"nf\">init_per_suite</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"nn\">io</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">format</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"Initializing test suite...</span><span class=\"si\">~n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n    <span class=\"nv\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"nf\">end_per_suite</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"nn\">io</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">format</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"Cleaning up test suite...</span><span class=\"si\">~n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n    <span class=\"nv\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">% Define test cases\n</span><span class=\"nf\">all</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">simple_test</span><span class=\"p\">].</span>\n\n<span class=\"nf\">simple_test</span><span class=\"p\">(_</span><span class=\"nv\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"nn\">io</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">format</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"Running simple test case...</span><span class=\"si\">~n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n    <span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"nf\">assertEqual</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">42</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">21</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"mi\">21</span><span class=\"p\">).</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>这个测试套件通过 <code>suite/0</code> 定义一个测试套件，使用 <code>init_per_suite/1</code> 和 <code>end_per_suite/1</code> 进行初始化和清理，并定义一个测试用例 <code>simple_test/1</code>，该用例断言 <code>21 + 21 = 42</code>。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect4\"> <h5 id=\"_writing_test_cases_and_test_suites_2\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_writing_test_cases_and_test_suites_2\" href=\"#_writing_test_cases_and_test_suites_2\">编写测试用例与测试套件</a></h5> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Common Test 中的测试用例就是执行断言和检查的函数。它们遵循简单的命名约定，并且必须列在 <code>all/0</code> 函数中。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Common Test 在 <code>ct.hrl</code> 中提供了断言宏：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"nf\">assert</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">Expression</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n<span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"nf\">assertEqual</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">Expected</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">Actual</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n<span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"nf\">assertNotEqual</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">Unexpected</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">Actual</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n<span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"nf\">assertMatch</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">Pattern</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">Expression</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n<span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"nf\">assertNotMatch</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">Pattern</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">Expression</span><span class=\"p\">).</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>多个测试用例的示例：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"nf\">all</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">math_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">string_test</span><span class=\"p\">].</span>\n\n<span class=\"nf\">math_test</span><span class=\"p\">(_</span><span class=\"nv\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"nf\">assertEqual</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">5</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n\n<span class=\"nf\">string_test</span><span class=\"p\">(_</span><span class=\"nv\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"nf\">assertEqual</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"hello\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nn\">string</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">to_lower</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"HELLO\"</span><span class=\"p\">)).</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>测试用例可以从配置文件或先前的初始化函数中接收参数。</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"nf\">init_per_testcase</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">math_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">[{</span><span class=\"n\">base_value</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">}</span> <span class=\"p\">|</span> <span class=\"nv\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"nf\">init_per_testcase</span><span class=\"p\">(_,</span> <span class=\"nv\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nv\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"nf\">math_test</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"nv\">Base</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nn\">proplists</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">get_value</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">base_value</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n    <span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"nf\">assertEqual</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">Base</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">).</span></code></pre> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect4\"> <h5 id=\"_running_tests_and_analyzing_results_2\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_running_tests_and_analyzing_results_2\" href=\"#_running_tests_and_analyzing_results_2\">运行测试并分析结果</a></h5> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>测试通过 <code>ct_run</code> 或 <code>rebar3</code> 来执行。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在 Erlang shell 中：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"nn\">ct</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">run_test</span><span class=\"p\">([{</span><span class=\"n\">dir</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s\">\"test/\"</span><span class=\"p\">}]).</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>使用 <code>rebar3</code>：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"sh\">rebar3 ct</code></pre> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect4\"> <h5 id=\"_understanding_test_output\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_understanding_test_output\" href=\"#_understanding_test_output\">理解测试输出</a></h5> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Common Test 会在 <code>_build/test/logs/</code> 目录下生成详细的日志。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>日志文件：</p> </div> <div class=\"ulist\"> <ul> <li> <p><code>ct_run.*.log</code> - 主测试运行日志</p> </li> <li> <p><code>suite.log</code> - 记录特定测试套件的执行</p> </li> <li> <p><code>testcase.log</code> - 记录特定测试用例的执行</p> </li> </ul> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>为了进行实时调试，你可以启用详细输出：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"nn\">ct</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">run_test</span><span class=\"p\">([{</span><span class=\"n\">dir</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s\">\"test/\"</span><span class=\"p\">},</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">verbosity</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">high</span><span class=\"p\">}]).</span></code></pre> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect3\"> <h4 id=\"_other_testing_frameworks_and_techniques\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_other_testing_frameworks_and_techniques\" href=\"#_other_testing_frameworks_and_techniques\">20.1.3. 其他测试框架与技术</a></h4> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Common Test 是 Erlang/OTP 自带的标准测试框架，但开发者还经常使用其他一些测试框架和方法来提高测试覆盖率、可靠性和自动化程度。这些工具提供了诸如 <strong>基于属性的测试</strong> 和 <strong>模拟（mocking）</strong> 这类额外能力，有助于验证 Erlang 应用程序中复杂的行为与交互。虽然对这些技术的详细探讨超出了本书的范围，但本节会简要介绍它们，供有兴趣扩充自己测试工具箱的读者参考。</p> </div> <div class=\"sect4\"> <h5 id=\"_property_based_testing\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_property_based_testing\" href=\"#_property_based_testing\">基于属性的测试</a></h5> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>基于属性的测试与传统单元测试不同，它围绕系统应当始终满足的属性生成大量测试用例。开发者不再逐条编写测试用例，而是定义属性，然后由框架自动生成输入，以验证这些属性在广泛场景下都成立。对于捕捉手工编写的测试可能覆盖不到的边界情况，这种方法尤为有用。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Erlang 生态中两个广泛使用的基于属性的测试库是 <strong>QuickCheck</strong> 和 <strong>PropEr</strong>：</p> </div> <div class=\"ulist\"> <ul> <li> <p><strong>QuickCheck</strong>（有商业版和开源版）是一个强大的工具，用于生成随机测试用例，并把失败的用例收缩为最小反例。</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>PropEr</strong>（Property-Based Testing for Erlang）是一个能力相近的开源替代方案，支持带类型规格的属性定义、生成器以及有状态测试。</p> </li> </ul> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>基于属性的测试非常适合验证算法、协议以及输入空间复杂的系统。不过，它要求思维方式的转变：从编写明确的测试用例转向定义系统不变式与约束条件。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect4\"> <h5 id=\"_mocking\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_mocking\" href=\"#_mocking\">Mock</a></h5> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>模拟（mocking）是一种测试技术，用受控的替代品取代依赖项或外部组件。它在 <strong>单元测试</strong> 中尤为有用，因为把函数或模块与其依赖项隔离开来，可以更容易地测试特定行为，而不必依赖完整的系统集成。</p> </div> <div class=\"ulist\"> <ul> <li> <p>模拟让你能够 <strong>在隔离环境下测试代码</strong>，确保无论依赖项的实际实现如何，函数都能正确地表现。</p> </li> <li> <p>它们通过避免与数据库、网络服务等外部系统交互，<strong>加快测试执行速度</strong>。</p> </li> <li> <p>模拟使得 <strong>对边界情况进行受控测试</strong> 成为可能，例如模拟依赖项的超时、失败或意外响应。</p> </li> </ul> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>与某些面向对象语言中模拟框架司空见惯的情况不同，Erlang 的函数式特性和消息传递模型要求采用不同的模拟思路。一些常见策略包括：</p> </div> <div class=\"ulist\"> <ul> <li> <p><strong>通过函数覆写进行手工模拟</strong>：使用高阶函数或显式地替换模块。</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>使用 <code>meck</code></strong>：一个流行的模拟库，允许在运行时替换模块函数，以实现受控测试。</p> </li> <li> <p><strong>基于进程的模拟</strong>：用返回预定义响应的轻量级进程来模拟外部系统。</p> </li> </ul> </div> <div class=\"sect5\"> <h6 id=\"_best_practices_for_mocking\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_best_practices_for_mocking\" href=\"#_best_practices_for_mocking\">Mock 的最佳实践</a></h6> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在 Erlang 测试中使用模拟时，请考虑以下最佳实践：</p> </div> <div class=\"ulist\"> <ul> <li> <p><strong>只在必要时</strong>使用模拟——当集成测试可行时，优先采用真实实现。</p> </li> <li> <p>让模拟出来的行为保持 <strong>贴近真实</strong>，以免测试结果产生误导。</p> </li> <li> <p>在适用的情况下，把模拟与 <strong>基于属性的测试</strong> 结合起来，在控制特定依赖项的同时获得更广的测试覆盖。</p> </li> </ul> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>虽然基于属性的测试和模拟在某些测试场景中非常有价值，但要发挥效果，需要更深入的理解和符合最佳实践的落地方式。若想更全面地了解这些主题，建议读者参阅专门资料，例如《Property-Based Testing with PropEr, Erlang, and Elixir》<sup class=\"footnote\" id=\"_footnote_source-testing-property-based-testing-with-proper-erlang-and-elixir\">[<a class=\"footnote\" data-ref=\"_footnotedef_75\" href=\"#_footnotedef_75\" id=\"_footnoteref_75\">75</a>]</sup> 和 Meck <sup class=\"footnote\" id=\"_footnote_source-testing-meck\">[<a class=\"footnote\" data-ref=\"_footnotedef_76\" href=\"#_footnotedef_76\" id=\"_footnoteref_76\">76</a>]</sup>。</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"footnotes\"><hr><div class=\"footnote\" id=\"_footnotedef_74\"> <a data-ref=\"_footnoteref_74\" href=\"#_footnoteref_74\">74</a>. <a class=\"bare\" href=\"https://www.erlang.org/doc/apps/eunit/chapter.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.erlang.org/doc/apps/eunit/chapter.html</a> </div><div class=\"footnote\" id=\"_footnotedef_75\"> <a data-ref=\"_footnoteref_75\" href=\"#_footnoteref_75\">75</a>. <a class=\"bare\" href=\"https://pragprog.com/titles/fhproper/property-based-testing-with-proper-erlang-and-elixir/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://pragprog.com/titles/fhproper/property-based-testing-with-proper-erlang-and-elixir/</a> </div><div class=\"footnote\" id=\"_footnotedef_76\"> <a data-ref=\"_footnoteref_76\" href=\"#_footnoteref_76\">76</a>. <a class=\"bare\" href=\"https://github.com/eproxus/meck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/eproxus/meck</a> </div></div>"}